    <data key="d0">GoDaddy - Zero-Trust Cloud Architecture and Isolation Boundary</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Demonstrates multi-account isolation boundaries, NAT gateways for outbound traffic without VPC peering, and EKS cluster deployments across public/private subnets in isolated AWS accounts.</data>
